WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.901 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Real quick --
obviously as I've announced,

00:00:01.901 --> 00:00:04.037
we're gonna have a second child.
It's gonna be a son.

00:00:04.037 --> 00:00:07.307 size:84% position:42%
Dad, what do you think?
Two? Keep going? Stop?

00:00:07.307 --> 00:00:10.643 align:start size:94% position:6%
-My philosophy was
two hands, two kids.

00:00:10.643 --> 00:00:11.878 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's it?
-That was it.

00:00:11.878 --> 00:00:12.746 line:92%
-If you can't handle more...

00:00:12.746 --> 00:00:14.914 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No. That was the most
I could handle.

00:00:14.914 --> 00:00:15.482 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Okay, gotcha.

00:00:15.482 --> 00:00:16.649 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think you did
a really good job.

00:00:16.649 --> 00:00:20.186 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I thought so, too.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:20.186 --> 00:00:22.055 align:start size:94% position:6%
-All right, guys,
we cleared the air,

00:00:22.055 --> 00:00:22.789 line:92%
but there was something --

00:00:22.789 --> 00:00:25.125 align:start size:94% position:6%
I want to say
it was about 10 years ago now

00:00:25.125 --> 00:00:26.826 align:start size:94% position:6%
that was a genuine
clearing the air

00:00:26.826 --> 00:00:28.561 align:start size:94% position:6%
that sort of happened
at a dinner

00:00:28.561 --> 00:00:30.130 align:start size:94% position:6%
where it was just
the four of us.

00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:32.265 align:start size:94% position:6%
First, let's talk about
Petey the Rabbit.

00:00:32.265 --> 00:00:35.368 align:start size:94% position:6%
Who would like to explain what
kind of rabbit Petey was?

00:00:35.368 --> 00:00:38.505 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, it was Poshy's rabbit,
so he should start.

00:00:38.505 --> 00:00:44.844
-Petey was a girl, but my father
had a pet -- not a pet --

00:00:44.844 --> 00:00:45.645 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-A stuffed animal.

00:00:45.645 --> 00:00:47.580 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Rabbit named Petey
when he was growing up,

00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:50.550 align:start size:94% position:6%
and he talked about it a lot,
which was weird.

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:51.718 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:51.718 --> 00:00:55.121 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So I got a rabbit,
and I named her Petey.

00:00:55.121 --> 00:00:59.325 line:92%
And rabbits smell terribly.

00:00:59.325 --> 00:01:00.960 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-In their little hutches.

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:02.562 align:start size:94% position:6%
So we kept her in a hutch
in the garage.

00:01:02.562 --> 00:01:05.732 align:start size:94% position:6%
We'd bring her out and she'd
bounce around the house

00:01:05.732 --> 00:01:07.400 line:92%
and always try to run away

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:09.002 align:start size:94% position:6%
'cause that's what
she wanted to do.

00:01:09.002 --> 00:01:09.803 align:start size:94% position:6%
But I loved her.
-Yeah.

00:01:09.803 --> 00:01:12.605 align:start size:94% position:6%
So how old were you
on the fateful day?

00:01:12.605 --> 00:01:13.807 line:92%
-I don't -- I don't know.

00:01:13.807 --> 00:01:16.910 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I think -- I think maybe 7.
And he was 9.

00:01:16.910 --> 00:01:18.378 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay.
-You were 9.

00:01:18.378 --> 00:01:19.512 line:92%
-Yeah, something like that.

00:01:19.512 --> 00:01:23.883
-So what happened was, Poshy
came upstairs and he said,

00:01:23.883 --> 00:01:25.985 line:92%
"Petey's in the cutest position.

00:01:25.985 --> 00:01:28.154 align:start size:94% position:6%
You've got to come down
and see him."

00:01:28.154 --> 00:01:29.422 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
So I went down.

00:01:29.422 --> 00:01:31.424 align:start size:94% position:6%
And the position
was rigor mortis.

00:01:31.424 --> 00:01:33.026 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:33.026 --> 00:01:35.028 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Hold that.

00:01:35.028 --> 00:01:36.930 size:81% position:41% line:92%
This was the position.

00:01:36.930 --> 00:01:39.265 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:39.265 --> 00:01:46.673
-So, this one, this one says to
Seth, "Take Seth away and..."

00:01:46.673 --> 00:01:47.207 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-I can tell you.

00:01:47.207 --> 00:01:51.177 align:start size:94% position:6%
He says to me, "I feel weird
around dead things."

00:01:51.177 --> 00:01:53.847 size:78% position:39%
-Right. And he thinks
you're fine with it.

00:01:53.847 --> 00:01:54.280 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:01:54.280 --> 00:01:55.682 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Because you would
touch anything.

00:01:55.682 --> 00:01:57.984 size:75% position:38% line:92%
-That's true, but...

00:01:57.984 --> 00:02:02.622
I feel like you were encouraging
me to be a serial killer.

00:02:02.622 --> 00:02:05.058 align:start size:94% position:6%
Because you said, "I'm weird
with dead things.

00:02:05.058 --> 00:02:08.128 align:start size:94% position:6%
You have to go bury Petey."
Again, I was 9.

00:02:08.128 --> 00:02:08.561 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Right.

00:02:08.561 --> 00:02:10.163 align:start size:94% position:6%
And they don't call
New Hampshire

00:02:10.163 --> 00:02:11.331 line:92%
The Granite State for nothing.

00:02:11.331 --> 00:02:14.000 size:84% position:42%
-And it was the winter.
-And it was January,

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:16.369 line:92%
and it was about 20 below zero.

00:02:16.369 --> 00:02:18.705 line:92%
-Also, so, Josh was crying.

00:02:18.705 --> 00:02:23.376
You guys gave me a shoe box
and told me to go bury Petey.

00:02:23.376 --> 00:02:24.210 line:92%
Based on the rigor mortis,

00:02:24.210 --> 00:02:27.213
there was no way of getting
Petey's legs into the box.

00:02:27.213 --> 00:02:29.215 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's a technicality.
-Technicality.

00:02:29.215 --> 00:02:31.217 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But first,
before we know any of that,

00:02:31.217 --> 00:02:34.354
there's a rock that you put down
as a headstone,

00:02:34.354 --> 00:02:37.023 align:start size:94% position:6%
and we go out
and we have a ceremony.

00:02:37.023 --> 00:02:37.657 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yes. So, I say --

00:02:37.657 --> 00:02:42.162
I say Petey is buried, I put a
rock, a headstone, we come out.

00:02:42.162 --> 00:02:45.064
-And it was like in like a trail
where we would always sled,

00:02:45.064 --> 00:02:47.300 size:84% position:42%
and we'd always have to
build up a snow bank

00:02:47.300 --> 00:02:49.369 align:start size:94% position:6%
so we didn't go
over Petey's grave.

00:02:49.369 --> 00:02:50.069 line:92%
And Mom would walk by it.

00:02:50.069 --> 00:02:52.672 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then we're at this dinner
and you're like...

00:02:52.672 --> 00:02:53.606 line:92%
-Yeah, like 15 years later,

00:02:53.606 --> 00:02:55.341 align:start size:94% position:6%
and we're drinking,
we're having a fun time,

00:02:55.341 --> 00:02:56.209 line:92%
we're laughing about the past.

00:02:56.209 --> 00:02:58.244
And I say, "Hey, guys, do you
want to hear something funny?

00:02:58.244 --> 00:03:00.513 size:75% position:38% line:92%
I didn't bury Petey.

00:03:00.513 --> 00:03:06.986 align:start size:94% position:6%
I threw Petey in the garbage."
[ Laughter ]

00:03:06.986 --> 00:03:09.756 size:84% position:42% line:92%
-This is a real dagger.

00:03:09.756 --> 00:03:11.257 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It was so --
I thought everybody

00:03:11.257 --> 00:03:14.093 size:88% position:44%
would burst out laughing
and nobody did at all.

00:03:14.093 --> 00:03:17.330 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:17.330 --> 00:03:18.398 size:81% position:41% line:92%
-Yeah, it was daggers.

00:03:18.398 --> 00:03:19.432 size:81% position:41% line:92%
-It was daggers, yeah.

00:03:19.432 --> 00:03:20.200 size:84% position:42% line:92%
-Oh, there was -- Yeah.

00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:22.769 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You couldn't get the shovel
into the ground.

00:03:22.769 --> 00:03:23.603 size:88% position:44% line:92%
-No, that was the thing.

00:03:23.603 --> 00:03:24.971 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was 9 years old,
it was freezing,

00:03:24.971 --> 00:03:27.774
and I couldn't get any dirt up,
and all I could think was

00:03:27.774 --> 00:03:30.577 align:start size:94% position:6%
all Petey ever wanted to do
was run away.

00:03:30.577 --> 00:03:34.080 align:start size:94% position:6%
The worst thing to do would be
bury her on the property.

00:03:34.080 --> 00:03:34.647 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-That is true.

00:03:34.647 --> 00:03:37.283 size:88% position:44%
-I put her in a truck,
and I said, "Go, Petey."

00:03:37.283 --> 00:03:38.985 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:38.985 --> 00:03:41.854 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But I thought about this
for 20 years

00:03:41.854 --> 00:03:43.823 align:start size:94% position:6%
when I had to go
from one point to another.

00:03:43.823 --> 00:03:46.793 align:start size:94% position:6%
I would have to
walk around that rock.

00:03:46.793 --> 00:03:49.929 size:88% position:44% line:92%
And I've felt so stupid.

00:03:49.929 --> 00:03:52.298 size:78% position:39%
I didn't feel stupid
asking you to bury it

00:03:52.298 --> 00:03:53.099 line:92%
when you were 9 years old

00:03:53.099 --> 00:03:54.867 align:start size:94% position:6%
in frozen granite ground
in New Hampshire.

00:03:54.867 --> 00:03:57.670 align:start size:94% position:6%
But I did feel stupid
walking around that rock

00:03:57.670 --> 00:03:58.271 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
for 20 years.

00:03:58.271 --> 00:04:00.306 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, thank you, guys,
for forgiving me for that.

00:04:00.306 --> 00:04:02.976 line:92%
Hey, to Petey. Drink to Petey.

